@baseUrl = https://phonebook-backend-5u5x.onrender.com

### All people (should match your local database)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/persons

### Info page
GET {{baseUrl}}/info

### Add a person
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/persons
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "Live Person",
  "number": "555-0000"
}

### Update (paste a real id from the live GET all)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/persons/PASTE-A-REAL-24-CHAR-ID
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "Live Person",
  "number": "555-1111"
}

### Delete (paste a real id from the live GET all)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/persons/PASTE-A-REAL-24-CHAR-ID


### Name too short: expect 400 with a validation message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/persons
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "ab",
  "number": "09-1234556"
}

### Bad number format: expect 400 "... is not a valid phone number"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/persons
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "Valid Name",
  "number": "1234556"
}

### Valid person: expect 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/persons
content-type: application/json

{
  "name": "Good Person",
  "number": "040-22334455"
}